    -- Actually, simpler: The row is visible if member. The check constrains the transition.
    -- Rule R3: Claim unclaimed for self; Unclaim own. No claiming for others. No taking others.
    -- So: (old.claimed_by IS NULL AND new.claimed_by = auth.uid()) OR (old.claimed_by = auth.uid())
    -- And we must ensure new.claimed_by is either auth.uid() or null (if unclaiming)
